<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">vpn_key</span>
<div>
<p class="text-label-sm font-label-sm">Security Policy</p>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Users will be prompted to change their password on first login.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
